v 3
d odkrepeatmerge: Merge ODK repeat-group data into one wide dataset in questionnaire order
d
d Combines the main and repeat-group CSV files exported from ODK Central
d into one Stata dataset with one row per submission. Reads the XLSForm to
d find the repeat groups and their nesting, reshapes each group wide, merges
d it into its parent, and orders variables as in the questionnaire.
d
d Syntax: odkrepeatmerge using maincsv, xlsform(filename) [options]
d
d Requires: Stata 14
d Author: Arman Mahmud
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
f odkrepeatmerge.ado
f odkrepeatmerge.sthlp
